$NetBSD$

Implement GTK4 top-level lifecycle with GtkWindow and public GdkToplevel APIs.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted). wxWindows licence, like upstream.
Preserve wx close veto, activation, sizing, window state and nested grab lifetime.
Observe X11 events without stealing GDK dispatch; use public X11 WM protocols.
See tests/README.md for compositor boundaries and pending GUI acceptance.
https://docs.gtk.org/gtk4/class.Window.html
https://docs.gtk.org/gdk4-x11/signal.X11Display.xevent.html

